abstract: An open course repository by Isaac K. Nti for data technologies administration,
  with reproducible PostgreSQL/dbt labs, data governance, lifecycle management, access
  control, monitoring, AI ethics and governance, optional ingestion/promotion experiments,
  and a capstone portfolio.
